#1800
Immortal Map Room to the Spider Tunnels~
   The tunnels are entered by the player walking through one of six rooms in
the Xixieqi jungle and being "grabbed" and pulled beneath the surface. On
entry, a scroll of recall is placed randomly in the zone to enable the player
to get out if need be.
~
18 cdk 0
